[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6541.51, "timestamp": "01:49:01", "text": "好的。 复杂的情况可能会在这里发生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6543.35, "timestamp": "01:49:03", "text": "那里会有一个队伍重生点。 所以，要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6544.87, "timestamp": "01:49:04", "text": "小心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6548.629, "timestamp": "01:49:08", "text": "那边的建筑群在哪儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6550.95, "timestamp": "01:49:10", "text": "好的。 等待。 我们离阿博兰戈很近，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6552.55, "timestamp": "01:49:12", "text": "那么，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6554.55, "timestamp": "01:49:14", "text": "让我们去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6555.83, "timestamp": "01:49:15", "text": "创立一些东西吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6557.27, "timestamp": "01:49:17", "text": "维护。 你确定吗？   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6558.229, "timestamp": "01:49:18", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6561.91, "timestamp": "01:49:21", "text": "哦，我接到过那个任务，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6563.91, "timestamp": "01:49:23", "text": "嗯，是的。 它要么在维修"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6566.39, "timestamp": "01:49:26", "text": "中心，要么在生物研究机构。 所以，我们有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6569.03, "timestamp": "01:49:29", "text": "三种选择。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6572.629, "timestamp": "01:49:32", "text": "我的天哪，我明白了。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6575.43, "timestamp": "01:49:35", "text": "。 所以，你得说：哦，糟了，那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6578.47, "timestamp": "01:49:38", "text": "我的。 对，你只需要开枪就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6580.55, "timestamp": "01:49:40", "text": "你看到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6582.87, "timestamp": "01:49:42", "text": "有时候确实挺烦人的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6585.91, "timestamp": "01:49:45", "text": "我又卡住了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6593.43, "timestamp": "01:49:53", "text": "你甚至不能像《"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6596.629, "timestamp": "01:49:56", "text": "Apex英雄》里的探路者那样用抓钩。 把相机移到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6599.91, "timestamp": "01:49:59", "text": "另一边，然后"}]